{"seq":4,"slug":"operations","title":"运维篇导读","docCount":3,"url":"/h/frontend/frontend-micro-frontends/operations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"performance-optimization","title":"性能优化","url":"/h/frontend/frontend-micro-frontends/operations/performance-optimization","wordCount":660,"readingTime":3},{"seq":2,"slug":"monitoring-debugging","title":"监控与调试","url":"/h/frontend/frontend-micro-frontends/operations/monitoring-debugging","wordCount":745,"readingTime":3},{"seq":3,"slug":"migration-strategy","title":"迁移策略","url":"/h/frontend/frontend-micro-frontends/operations/migration-strategy","wordCount":960,"readingTime":4}],"introMarkdown":"# 运维篇导读\n\n微前端架构上线后的持续运营是另一场战争。本章覆盖生产环境中最常遇到的三类问题：加载性能的系统性优化（预加载、Tree Shaking、SSR）、运行时监控与跨应用调试手段、以及从单体到微前端（或从微前端回退到模块化单体）的渐进式迁移策略。运维篇的核心观点是：微前端不是终态，而是组织规模演进过程中的一个阶段性选择。\n"}